###

### Test 7: Get Account by Username (Alice)
POST {{AccountMcp_HostAddress}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 7,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "GetAccountByUserName",
    "arguments": {
      "userName": "alice.user@contoso.com"
    }
  }
}

###

### Test 8: Invalid Account ID (Error Case)
POST {{AccountMcp_HostAddress}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 8,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "GetAccountDetails",
    "arguments": {
      "accountId": "9999"
    }
  }
}

